    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003300/extras/529b22bf6be7bfcf7d56c87ff1e4950a.avif?t=1722026884\" /></div><br><br>&quot;Binary Syndrome&quot; is a PC-98 respect command-click android counseling ADV.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003300/extras/30301ea1b76fd927c73ac60d57d4450f.webp?t=1722026884\" /></div><br>The year is 2101, in a near future where the line between man and machine is fading.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003300/extras/f3392130a77585e47b7f2b26d0cf651e.poster.avif?t=1722026884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003300/extras/f3392130a77585e47b7f2b26d0cf651e.webm?t=1722026884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003300/extras/f3392130a77585e47b7f2b26d0cf651e.mp4?t=1722026884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A disease is discovered that causes an increase in 21grams in some androids, causing them to become incapable of reanimation.<br>The protagonist, who works as a counselor on the man-made island experimental city of Zelnoa Island, searches for a cure through counseling androids.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003300/extras/eff9e2377d1acbf4ab0b0b8c7876d925.webp?t=1722026884\" /></div><br>The game progresses in a command-click style. Select &quot;LOOK,&quot; &quot;TALK,&quot; &quot;THINK,&quot; &quot;MOVE,&quot; and &quot;DATA&quot; commands to counsel the client. If the game progresses well, information will be added to the &quot;KARTE&quot; of the &quot;DATA&quot; command, and the story will also be affected.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003300/extras/189feca68bd90aac405711ae73db9668.poster.avif?t=1722026884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003300/extras/189feca68bd90aac405711ae73db9668.webm?t=1722026884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003300/extras/189feca68bd90aac405711ae73db9668.mp4?t=1722026884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003300/extras/6c5c43cd92afe5042ae9b4cbad6a1abb.poster.avif?t=1722026884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003300/extras/6c5c43cd92afe5042ae9b4cbad6a1abb.webm?t=1722026884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003300/extras/6c5c43cd92afe5042ae9b4cbad6a1abb.mp4?t=1722026884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In addition to the main episode, there is a TIP feature that includes sub-episodes, a collection of resources, and explanations related to scientific terminology and psychotherapy. Use it to better understand the worldview and the client, and apply it to treatment.<br><br>Please enjoy the retro near-future world colored by FM sound  and 20 colors of pixel art picture.",
